Steps:
1. Create isolated homes: /tmp/p2-20260923/dsh-a and /tmp/p2-20260923/dsh-b, each with its own profiles/<name> containing an exact symlink to THIS tree's plugin so the real DSH loads the plugin from /root/zhijian/dsh-pack-center-dev.ZGtty5. Build the plugin first if required for real loading (pnpm build in this tree is allowed; it must not modify DSH core).
